@Comment:	Chi doesn't seem to be eating but Bro and Fat are involved in pancake making so I guess this is a mealtime tape; at end Mot announces that breakfast is over; Chi is taking an inventory of his Nintendo games and is deciding which games he would like as gifts; Mot occasionally talks about something else like jury duty or a trip to a Christmas store; Chi seems to be writing a Christmas wish list; Kendra comments , this kid sounds like a teenager. Is that showing more or less maturity than a seven year old?.....
